vancely-v1.0.13-Windows.zip"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LNXSeus/Advancely/tarball/v1.0.13","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LNXSeus/Advancely/zipball/v1.0.13","body":"Still working on a bigger main video, meaning I'm not quite ready to tackle the extensive list of features for Advancely, that includes Coop Support, more organized settings and custom positioning of goals.\r\n\r\n## This small release only includes a handful of fixes/patches:\r\n- Socials text on the overlay got corrected for consistency: `Donate to` -> `Support`.\r\n- Added [Dogmaster](https://www.twitch.tv/thedogmaster28) as a beta tester on Linux.\r\n- Added a Debug Stick icon texture (animated).\r\n<img width=\"345\" height=\"328\" alt=\"Debug Stick\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/27c240f0-d9f3-4b75-a159-93342cff6b64\" />\r\n\r\n- Added new background textures from InFectDilu!\r\n<img width=\"940\" height=\"366\" alt=\"InFectDilu Background textures\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/293f3a84-a06d-42e8-b597-8c0675931790\" />\r\n\r\n- Added [Zesskyo](https://www.twitch.tv/Zesskyo) as an Advancely Supporter!\r\n- Added [amazon affiliate link](https://amzn.to/4scdytw).\r\n- Added more socials to readme.\r\n- Added `25w14craftmine` `all_advancements` template.\r\n### **Advancely can now read the new 26.1 folder structure**: `advancements` -> `players/advancements` and `stats` -> `players/stats`. It's required to select 26.1 or later as the `Template Version`.\r\n<img width=\"428\" height=\"31\" alt=\"26 1 working\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/194b598c-3955-4afe-a3bc-852eca88f091\" />\r\n\r\n- Added 26.2 as a version already.\r\n- Added `1.18.2_advancements_file.json` within the `reference_files` folder.\r\n- Fixed issue with imports not working on macOS thanks to @amathew4538.\r\n- Introduced two new command line options: `--settings-file <path>` for a custom settings file location and `--disable-updater`. \r\n- Added all command line options to the bottom of [the main page](https://github.com/LNXSeus/Advancely?tab=readme-ov-file#command-line-arguments).\r\n<img width=\"510\" height=\"58\" alt=\"Disable updates command line\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fa0147b6-d53a-4c4e-9e97-4cfe6d587786\" />\r\n<img width=\"288\" height=\"49\" alt=\"version command line\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/66453172-fb55-4510-be91-86cd0b64921e\" />\r\n\r\n- Fixed file naming issue with `1.16 `all_advancements` templates` thanks to @R0dn3yS.\r\n- Fixed Linux-specific file-reading crash caused by `dmon.h`'s recursive file-watching potentially trying to watch a non-existent folder. Massive thanks to @R0dn3yS and @nikander100.\r\n\r\n***\r\n\r\n> Find more info on the [main tracker page](https://github.com/LNXSeus/Advancely)!\r\n\r\n***\r\n\r\n## *[Donations](https://streamlabs.com/lnxseus/tip) are always welcome! Make sure to mention `Advancely` in the donation message.*\r\n\r\nEnjoy the update!","mentions_count":3}